    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "19 Belarmine Vale is a beautifully presented and contemporary three-bedroom duplex home, ideally positioned within this highly regarded Castlethorn built residential development in Stepaside, Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed and filled with natural light, the property combines modern comfort with a welcoming sense of home, complemented by a sun-filled rear garden that enhances its overall appeal.\r\n\r\nThe generously proportioned accommodation is arranged to provide both comfort and functionality. On arrival, an inviting entrance hall offers generous storage and leads to a guest wc. The spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area forms the heart of the home and flows seamlessly into the bright living room, creating an inviting space, ideal for everyday living and entertaining alike. Upstairs, the layout includes a landing with a shelved hot press, three spacious bedrooms comprising two doubles and one single. The principal bedroom benefits from an ensuite bathroom, while a tastefully finished family bathroom serves the remaining rooms.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property enjoys private parking along with ample visitor parking close by, while a large adjoining green area provides a pleasant outlook and space for relaxed walks. The rear garden is a particular highlight, enjoying a desirable southerly orientation. It is attractively arranged with a paved patio area leading to a low maintenance lawn, framed by colourful planting that creates a welcoming setting for outdoor dining, relaxation, and entertaining. A timber garden shed provides practical additional storage.\r\n\r\nNumber 19 is superbly located in the foothills of the Dublin Mountains and within a short walk of Stepaside Village, which offers a wide range of shops, cafés, and restaurants. The surrounding Belarmine area is known for its strong sense of community and excellent local amenities, including a supermarket, restaurant, hair salon, pharmacy, crèche, and community centre. Further nearby amenities include Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Business Park, Beacon South Quarter, and Leopardstown Racecourse. The area is also well served by a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools.\r\n\r\nFor those who enjoy an active lifestyle, the location offers an abundance of outdoor and recreational opportunities, including hill walking and mountain biking trails, local tennis, rugby, and football clubs, and the expansive Fernhill Gardens, which extends to approximately 80 acres of landscaped public parkland.\r\n\r\nTransport connections are excellent, with the Luas Green Line at Glencairn just a short walk away. Dublin Bus routes 44, 47, and 118, along with the nearby M50 and N11, provide easy and convenient access to Dublin city centre and the wider surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway \r\nWith tiled floor, generous storage closet.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\nTiled floors, wash hand basin, wall mounted mirror, wc.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\nTiled floors, spot lighting, generous range of wall and floor units, partially tiled wall, granite countertop, stainless steel sink with mixer taps, stainless steel hooded extractor fan, Bosch dishwasher, Hoover washing machine, Bosch four plate hob, Bosch oven grill, Whirlpool fridge freezer, double doors to rear garden, double doors to living room.\r\n\r\nPantry\r\nTiled floors, generous storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nTimber style flooring, spot lighting, feature fireplace with gas insect and granite hearth.\r\n\r\nLanding \r\nwith timber style flooring, generous storage closet, spotlighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master)\r\nDouble bedroom, timber style floor flooring, generous range of storage, television point.\r\n\r\nEnsuite Bathroom\r\nTiled floors, partially tiled walls, wash hand basin, wall mounted mirror, wc, step in shower with chrome shower attachment.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom with timber style of flooring, generous storage, television point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nSingle bedroom with timber style flooring, television point.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nTiled floors, partially tiled walls, wc, wash hand basin, bath with chrome shower attachment."
      },
